Point each `/create:*` row of the markdown agent at its sk-doc mode packet's entry file,
`SKILL.md`, instead of at a template file inside the packet's `assets/` folder. The packet's
entry file names the template, so a renamed template no longer breaks this agent.

Files (exactly two, same change in each):
1. .skilled/agents/markdown.md
2. .claude/agents/markdown.md

